OL,3,GNEWSAArtist to paint every pub in city
OL,4,Ato create 'legacy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn award-winning artist has embarked on
OL,7,Fa mission to paint every pub in
OL,8,FLiverpool in a bid to leave a "legacy".
OL,10,FGary North, who won Lancashire Artist
OL,11,Fof the Year in 2025, has already
OL,12,Fcompleted about 150 of the 285
OL,13,Festimated pubs in the city.
OL,15,FHe said after winning the accolade last
OL,16,Fyear he wanted to focus on "legacy
OL,17,Frather than sales".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
