OL,3,GNEWSAArtist to paint every pub in city
OL,4,Ato create 'legacy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe told the BBC: "I wanted to do
OL,7,Fsomething cool, and I was just going to
OL,8,Fpaint the city as it is and then I
OL,9,Fdidn't want to paint shops, modern
OL,10,Fshops, but the pubs are just beyond
OL,11,Fcool, they're fantastic."
